     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hvad siger du?**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "What did you say?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hvadbehager?**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Sorry? (formal)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hva'?**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "What? (informal)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Det forstår jeg ikke.**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I don't understand it.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hvad betyder det?**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "What does it mean?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Sig det lige igen!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Can you repeat it?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Langsomt, tak!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Slowly, please!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "The most useful phrases in this course! Use them without fear.",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The imperative",
     "texto": [
      "Drop the **-e** from the infinitive:\n\n- prøve → **prøv!** · spise → **spis!**\n- komme → **kom!** · drikke → **drik!** (double consonant → single)\n- se → **se!** (no -e, same)\n\nTo forbid: **Lad være med at** + infinitive: Lad være med at græde! (Don't cry!)"
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Going without «go»",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Danés",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Hvor **skal** du **hen**?",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Where are you going?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **skal** til bageren.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I'm going to the bakery.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **skal ud** i aften.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Tonight I'm going out.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **skal** i biografen.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I'm going to the cinema.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **vil hjem**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I want to go home.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **vil med**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I want to go with you.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "«lige» = please (almost)",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Danés",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Kan du ikke **lige** lukke døren?",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Could you close the door for me, please?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Vil du **lige** flytte dig lidt?",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Could you move a little, please?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "**lige** softens a request. It does the job of English «please».",
     "tutora": ""
    }
